        <td>Default conversational chat, quick code snippets, refactoring, and large repo scans.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>coder-smart</code> (Router)</td>
        <td><code>gemini-2.0-flash</code> ➔ <code>claude-3-7-sonnet</code> ➔ <code>deepseek-r1</code></td>
        <td>Up to 1M tokens</td>
        <td>🚀 Smart Multi-Tier</td>
        <td>Multi-tier autonomous coding agent loop with automatic fallback.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
